      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so quiet now. i keep thinking i hear his collar jingling in the other room but then i remember he's not coming back. the house just feels... empty. like it's not even my home anymore. just a bunch of walls and silence. i don't even see the point in making breakfast or doing anything. what's the use in all this if everything just ends up like this?",
